      "content": "thanks for this. i just ran it through the system and it's actually scoring pretty low on the length metric—it's a bit too brief for the library requirements. \n\ncan you expand on this? i really need more depth and detail to get that score up, but i'm telling you again: please don't just loop the same ideas or use filler. try to include more mathematical context, talk about the derivation or the implications in specific experimental setups (like single-slit diffraction) to add legitimate substance. just make it much longer and more thorough so it actually meets the threshold.",
